Bootlabs Commerce
=================

This repository is the Bootlabs Commerce application. It is not a maintained
fork of the Medusa core.

Medusa v2 is consumed exclusively as versioned npm dependencies
(`@medusajs/*`). Do not merge `upstream/main` or edit Medusa core sources.

Historical Medusa license texts (MIT and Enterprise Edition notice) from the
original GitHub fork are kept in:

- docs/licenses/MEDUSA-LICENSE.md
- docs/licenses/MEDUSA-ENTERPRISE-LICENSE.md
- docs/licenses/MEDUSA-SECURITY.md

Files adapted from the official Medusa DTC starter
(https://github.com/medusajs/dtc-starter) remain subject to the Medusa MIT
license in `docs/licenses/MEDUSA-LICENSE.md`.
